WEBVTT

00:00:00.480 --> 00:00:04.850
Show yourself and guide me to victory!

00:00:05.310 --> 00:00:07.370
Number 107!

00:00:08.940 --> 00:00:12.340
Galaxy-Eyes Tachyon Dragon!

00:00:17.080 --> 00:00:19.680
The 107th Number, he said?!

00:00:22.370 --> 00:00:24.020
Hey, the Numbers...

00:00:24.450 --> 00:00:26.600
Weren't there just 100 in total?!

00:00:26.620 --> 00:00:30.750
That's right! My memories were split into 100 different pieces!

00:00:34.250 --> 00:00:37.170
Then what is this Number?

00:00:50.310 --> 00:00:51.970
Shark! Rio-<i>san</i>!

00:00:54.220 --> 00:00:55.400
A Sphere Field!

00:00:55.650 --> 00:00:57.340
So it's already started?

00:00:57.520 --> 00:00:58.680
Kotori-<i>san</i>!

00:00:59.820 --> 00:01:01.250
What is going on here?

00:01:01.340 --> 00:01:02.420
Well...

00:01:04.820 --> 00:01:07.200
What's the matter? Why are you so impatient?

00:01:07.770 --> 00:01:09.850
You wish to fight that badly?

00:01:12.480 --> 00:01:14.540
Then let me fulfill your wish!

00:01:14.940 --> 00:01:18.800
Galaxy-Eyes Tachyon Dragon, attack Aspiring Emperor - Hope!

00:01:19.050 --> 00:01:21.620
I detach one Overlay Unit...

00:01:21.620 --> 00:01:24.340
...to negate the attack of the opposing Monster!

00:01:27.910 --> 00:01:29.600
Moon Barrier!

00:01:31.370 --> 00:01:35.400
With Moon Barrier and Overlay Chain equipped to Hope,

00:01:35.600 --> 00:01:38.710
you have strengthened your defense... Not a bad strategy.

00:01:38.740 --> 00:01:39.400
Yeah.

00:01:40.310 --> 00:01:42.370
Do you really think you'll survive like that?

00:01:42.420 --> 00:01:46.050
What?! Your battle should be over!

00:01:46.170 --> 00:01:51.540
How naive! I activate Galaxy-Eyes Tachyon Dragon's Monster Effect!

00:01:51.850 --> 00:01:54.970
Once per turn, when all battles are finished,

00:01:55.220 --> 00:01:57.280
by detaching one Overlay Unit,

00:01:57.910 --> 00:02:03.020
it negates the effects of all Monsters on the field
except for Galaxy-Eyes Tachyon Dragon,

00:02:03.420 --> 00:02:06.400
and their Attack and Defense Points return to normal!

00:02:06.680 --> 00:02:09.600
Tachyon Transmigration!

00:02:13.000 --> 00:02:15.170
Wha... What is this?!

00:02:25.910 --> 00:02:27.140
Hope is...!

00:02:27.220 --> 00:02:29.250
Then, during this turn,

00:02:29.600 --> 00:02:34.510
for each card that activated its effect during battle, Tachyon Dragon will...

00:02:34.620 --> 00:02:36.760
...gain 1000 Attack Points!

00:02:37.080 --> 00:02:40.340
Reflect through space and time to be reborn!

00:02:42.050 --> 00:02:45.110
Galaxy-Eyes Tachyon Dragon!

00:02:50.250 --> 00:02:53.770
Then, when I use this effect during my turn,

00:02:54.110 --> 00:02:57.530
Tachyon Dragon can attack once again!

00:02:57.970 --> 00:02:59.000
Impossible!

00:02:59.140 --> 00:03:01.200
This Monster is able to return to the past,

00:03:01.200 --> 00:03:05.800
and even select the future that has its own advantage?!

00:03:06.400 --> 00:03:08.450
Go, Tachyon Dragon!

00:03:08.770 --> 00:03:12.250
Tachyon Spiral of Destruction!

00:03:14.200 --> 00:03:16.920
This is bad, Yuma! This attack...

00:03:29.710 --> 00:03:30.430
Yuma!

00:03:38.280 --> 00:03:39.220
Yuma!

00:03:41.450 --> 00:03:44.200
Yuma, are you all right? Get a hold of yourself!

00:03:44.400 --> 00:03:45.280
How weak.

00:03:46.220 --> 00:03:48.650
How weak these things called 'humans' are.

00:03:49.080 --> 00:03:52.250
Look at his condition after just one blow from Tachyon Dragon.

00:03:55.370 --> 00:03:58.370
That's right, Yuma Tsukumo. Stand up.

00:03:58.910 --> 00:04:01.910
It would trouble me if you didn't finish this Duel.

00:04:02.250 --> 00:04:06.620
Stand up to lose miserably,
 then hand over all your Numbers to me!

00:04:07.000 --> 00:04:08.220
That bastard!

00:04:11.020 --> 00:04:11.850
Yuma!

00:04:12.400 --> 00:04:15.340
What's the matter? You can't even stand up?

00:04:15.680 --> 00:04:18.190
Then how about an honorable surrender?

00:04:18.850 --> 00:04:21.970
I... I won't surrender.

00:04:22.310 --> 00:04:26.250
If I loose here, Astral will... Astral will...

00:04:27.020 --> 00:04:27.940
Yuma...

00:04:28.970 --> 00:04:30.800
That's why... no matter what...

00:04:31.600 --> 00:04:32.620
I...

00:04:33.880 --> 00:04:37.080
In that case, I will Duel in Yuma's place!

00:04:37.140 --> 00:04:37.820
Wait!

00:04:47.540 --> 00:04:50.000
I will continue this Duel!

00:04:50.570 --> 00:04:53.540
Kaito.. You keep out of this!

00:04:54.000 --> 00:04:55.000
They're calling...

00:04:56.140 --> 00:04:59.770
Galaxy-Eyes is calling out to Galaxy-Eyes.

00:05:00.200 --> 00:05:01.850
Rio... You...

00:05:02.420 --> 00:05:04.220
After transcending distant dimensions,

00:05:04.970 --> 00:05:09.420
the two dragons, who have encountered each other once before,
 are drawn to each other again.

00:05:09.550 --> 00:05:11.250
The two dragons, you say...?

00:05:15.370 --> 00:05:16.570
That guy...

00:05:39.680 --> 00:05:41.570
Ah! K-Kaito-<i>sama</i>!

00:05:51.020 --> 00:05:52.420
Kai... to...

00:05:52.850 --> 00:05:56.510
Leave the rest to me. You guys can take a break.

00:05:56.620 --> 00:05:57.740
Sorry, Kaito.

00:05:58.280 --> 00:06:02.170
Don't worry. This is my issue as well.

00:06:02.710 --> 00:06:03.970
Your issue?

00:06:04.910 --> 00:06:10.050
There can only be one person using Galaxy-Eyes, and that is me.

00:06:10.540 --> 00:06:13.710
Finally finished greeting that loser?

00:06:14.450 --> 00:06:16.540
Since you invited me here,

00:06:17.110 --> 00:06:19.250
I can take it that you want to fight me?

00:06:19.800 --> 00:06:22.310
It's not me who invited you.

00:06:22.510 --> 00:06:25.420
The Galaxy-Eyes was calling the other Galaxy-Eyes.

00:06:25.710 --> 00:06:29.650
Then you have no objections if I take on the Duel from here?

00:06:30.080 --> 00:06:30.820
Nope.

00:06:32.110 --> 00:06:35.330
I set one card and end my turn.

00:06:36.540 --> 00:06:40.740
Then Galaxy-Eyes Tachyon Dragon's Attack Power returns to normal.

00:06:41.480 --> 00:06:45.510
Now come, you who owns another Galaxy-Eyes.

00:06:45.880 --> 00:06:47.540
That's just what I wanted!

00:06:47.600 --> 00:06:52.890
I'll teach you which of us is the true user of Galaxy-Eyes!

00:06:55.200 --> 00:06:57.410
<i>It's just beginning now</i>

00:06:57.410 --> 00:07:03.380
<i>This story continues to be etched into my heart endlessly</i>

00:07:03.380 --> 00:07:06.090
<i>These feelings... burning up inside!</i>

00:07:15.890 --> 00:07:18.440
<i>Preparations for the fight are ready</i>

00:07:18.440 --> 00:07:21.520
<i>I can already hear the shivering of my heart</i>

00:07:21.690 --> 00:07:26.030
<i>Been waiting this whole time</i>

00:07:26.030 --> 00:07:28.400
<i>I may meet with defeat...</i>

00:07:28.610 --> 00:07:31.620
<i>But that's exactly why I have to stand back up</i>

00:07:31.820 --> 00:07:36.160
<i>Need to get stronger again</i>

00:07:36.330 --> 00:07:38.290
<i>It's good to believe</i>

00:07:38.460 --> 00:07:41.000
<i>The "now", more than ever before, is</i>

00:07:41.500 --> 00:07:43.460
<i>but another limit to break down</i>

00:07:43.460 --> 00:07:46.510
<i>I can cross with ease</i>

00:07:46.800 --> 00:07:48.970
<i>It's just beginning now</i>

00:07:48.970 --> 00:07:55.010
<i>This story continues to be etched into my heart endlessly</i>

00:07:55.010 --> 00:07:57.770
<i>These feelings... burning up inside!</i>

00:07:57.810 --> 00:07:59.230
<i>Right here in my hand,</i>

00:07:59.230 --> 00:08:03.940
<i>I'm holding a powerful trump card.</i>

00:08:04.060 --> 00:08:12.990
<i>With an unbreakable heart, I face toward my dream!</i>

00:08:27.860 --> 00:08:31.070
<i>The other Galaxy-Eyes user, Kaito...</i>

00:08:31.190 --> 00:08:35.950
"The Astronomic Dimensional Dragon!!
 Galaxy-Eyes Tachyon Dragon"

00:08:31.900 --> 00:08:35.910
<i>I had been thinking that I was fated to fight him sooner or later, but...</i>

00:08:36.570 --> 00:08:39.830
It may have been due to Tachyon Dragon's rage as well.

00:08:40.240 --> 00:08:43.040
Here goes! My turn! Draw!

00:08:43.250 --> 00:08:47.080
I activate the Magic Card, Photon Trade, from my hand!

00:08:47.380 --> 00:08:51.010
With this card, by sending one 'Photon' Monster
 from my hand to the Graveyard,

00:08:51.010 --> 00:08:53.470
I can draw two cards from my deck!

00:08:55.340 --> 00:08:56.970
Come, Photon Slasher!

00:08:58.180 --> 00:09:02.600
When there are no Monsters on my field,
 this Monster can be Special Summoned!

00:09:03.140 --> 00:09:06.270
Then I Normal Summon Photon Crusher!

00:09:10.270 --> 00:09:12.280
Now the Summoning Conditions have been met.

00:09:12.320 --> 00:09:13.070
It's coming!

00:09:13.110 --> 00:09:17.030
I release these two Monsters with 2000 or more Attack Points!

00:09:17.360 --> 00:09:19.160
The Galaxy that shines within the Darkness,

00:09:19.160 --> 00:09:22.790
Become the Light of Hope and obey me as my servant!

00:09:26.080 --> 00:09:30.040
Appear, Galaxy-Eyes Photon Dragon!

00:09:37.340 --> 00:09:40.390
Are those two really calling out to each other?!

00:09:44.560 --> 00:09:45.890
What's that?!

00:09:46.230 --> 00:09:50.060
The Galaxy-Eyes is resonating with the Galaxy-Eyes.

00:09:51.190 --> 00:09:53.150
I can feel something tremendous...

00:09:53.280 --> 00:09:56.450
What on earth is going on with these two?

00:10:14.630 --> 00:10:15.710
This is...

00:10:15.920 --> 00:10:19.140
Incomprehensible! This phenomenon is incomprehensible!

00:10:24.720 --> 00:10:29.810
When two Galaxy-Eyes are aligned,
 a gate to immense power shall be opened.

00:10:30.270 --> 00:10:32.360
That's the legend I heard.

00:10:32.610 --> 00:10:34.280
What about it?

00:10:35.650 --> 00:10:40.070
You will leave here losing miserably,
 so there's no need for you to know.

00:10:40.280 --> 00:10:42.740
Then I'll just ask you after I've <i>won</i>!

00:10:43.240 --> 00:10:47.960
Galaxy-Eyes Photon Dragon, attack Galaxy-Eyes Tachyon Dragon!

00:10:51.580 --> 00:10:55.550
At this moment, I activate Galaxy-Eyes Photon Dragon's effect!

00:10:55.920 --> 00:10:58.090
Both Monsters are Banished!

00:10:58.510 --> 00:11:03.470
Now all of your Monster's Overlay Units will be sent to the Graveyard.

00:11:04.560 --> 00:11:07.560
Then the Monsters Banished by this effect...

00:11:07.730 --> 00:11:11.270
...will be Special Summoned to the field when the battle is over!

00:11:12.150 --> 00:11:17.440
Also, for every Overlay Unit sent to the Graveyard, Galaxy-Eyes...

00:11:17.610 --> 00:11:19.900
...gains 500 Attack Points!

00:11:25.160 --> 00:11:28.950
When Galaxy-Eyes Tachyon Dragon loses its Overlay Unit,

00:11:28.950 --> 00:11:30.790
it's like pulling out its fangs!

00:11:31.040 --> 00:11:32.460
Is that <i>so</i>?

00:11:33.080 --> 00:11:36.840
I activate the Quick-Play Magic, Instant Overlay!

00:11:37.050 --> 00:11:41.720
With this card, if there is no Overlay Unit
 attached to an Xyz Monster on the field,

00:11:41.930 --> 00:11:45.180
I can use this card as its Overlay Unit!

00:11:46.890 --> 00:11:48.520
What a pity!

00:11:48.520 --> 00:11:52.600
I activate Galaxy-Eyes Tachyon Dragon's Monster Effect!

00:11:53.600 --> 00:11:55.730
By detaching one Overlay Unit,

00:11:56.020 --> 00:12:00.280
I negate all effects from Monsters on the field except Tachyon Dragon itself,

00:12:00.440 --> 00:12:03.610
and their Attack and Defense Points return to normal!

00:12:04.450 --> 00:12:07.370
Tachyon Transmigration!

00:12:12.290 --> 00:12:15.500
Reflect through space and time to be reborn!

00:12:16.210 --> 00:12:19.340
Galaxy-Eyes Tachyon Dragon!

00:12:28.180 --> 00:12:32.350
Now I can't use Galaxy-Eyes Photon Dragon's Monster Effect!

00:12:32.980 --> 00:12:35.770
Also, a card's effect activated during this battle,

00:12:35.810 --> 00:12:38.650
which is the Instant Overlay I just used.

00:12:38.770 --> 00:12:43.360
Therefore, Tachyon Dragon gains 1000 Attack Points!

00:12:44.990 --> 00:12:48.330
<i>I can negate my opponent's attack with Photonize,</i>

00:12:48.580 --> 00:12:51.580
<i>and my Light-Attribute Monster's Attack Power...</i>

00:12:51.750 --> 00:12:54.250
<i>...will increase by the Attack Power of the opposing Monster.</i>

00:12:55.040 --> 00:12:56.420
<i>If this works...</i>

00:12:57.880 --> 00:13:00.920
I set one card and end my turn.

00:13:04.050 --> 00:13:06.470
My turn! Draw!

00:13:11.180 --> 00:13:15.980
From my hand, I activate the Magic Card, Tractor Reverse!

00:13:17.230 --> 00:13:21.980
This card, when an Xyz Monster I control has no Overlay Unit,

00:13:22.280 --> 00:13:24.490
gains control of the opponent's set card...

00:13:24.490 --> 00:13:29.280
and together with this card,
 they become the Overlay Units of that Xyz Monster!

00:13:29.450 --> 00:13:30.410
What?!

00:13:36.960 --> 00:13:41.500
By the look on your face,
 I'd say your trump card to turn this around was taken away!

00:13:41.840 --> 00:13:46.300
With this, Tachyon Dragon has two Overlay Units!

00:13:46.840 --> 00:13:52.430
Galaxy-Eyes Tachyon Dragon attacks Galaxy-Eyes Photon Dragon!

00:13:53.350 --> 00:13:57.020
Then I activate the Quick-Play Magic, Tachyon Drive!

00:13:57.900 --> 00:14:01.360
With the effect of this card, one Tachyon Dragon on my field

00:14:01.400 --> 00:14:04.820
is not affected by the effects of other Spells or Traps!

00:14:11.240 --> 00:14:12.950
Even though they have the same Attack Power,

00:14:13.410 --> 00:14:16.500
Numbers can only be destroyed by other Numbers.

00:14:16.710 --> 00:14:18.370
Then, at this moment,

00:14:18.620 --> 00:14:22.840
I activate Galaxy-Eyes Tachyon Dragon's Monster Effect!

00:14:23.340 --> 00:14:26.300
I detach one Overlay Unit!

00:14:26.550 --> 00:14:29.300
Tachyon Transmigration!

00:14:39.440 --> 00:14:41.110
Shit! Again?!

00:14:42.190 --> 00:14:46.440
During this battle I activated one card, Tachyon Drive.

00:14:46.740 --> 00:14:51.950
Therefore, the Attack Power of Tachyon Dragon increases by 1000 points!

00:14:52.320 --> 00:14:56.120
Tachyon Drive not only protects Tachyon Dragon,

00:14:56.620 --> 00:15:01.920
but by increasing its Attack Power,
 it also is meant to crush the opponent.

00:15:02.500 --> 00:15:04.380
This'll be bad if this keeps up...!

00:15:04.630 --> 00:15:10.300
You should be honored to end your life
 on this noble dragon's claws!

00:15:10.470 --> 00:15:13.470
Galaxy-Eyes Tachyon Dragon, Direct Attack!

00:15:14.010 --> 00:15:17.430
Tachyon Spiral of Destruction!

00:15:26.570 --> 00:15:28.030
K-Kaito...!

00:15:29.740 --> 00:15:32.780
With this, the true Galaxy-Eyes user is-

00:15:39.250 --> 00:15:40.080
What?!

00:15:44.840 --> 00:15:46.340
Impossible! How?!

00:15:46.710 --> 00:15:50.760
I activated Photon Spectre's Monster Effect from the Graveyard.

00:15:51.550 --> 00:15:52.300
What?

00:15:52.680 --> 00:15:56.510
Tachyon Drive only stops the effects of Spells and Traps.

00:15:56.510 --> 00:15:58.810
In other words, Monster Effects are not included.

00:15:59.060 --> 00:16:01.350
When I received the Direct Attack,

00:16:01.640 --> 00:16:04.270
I banished Photon Spectre from the Graveyard...

00:16:04.480 --> 00:16:07.730
...to target one Photon Monster in the Graveyard with its effects negated,

00:16:08.030 --> 00:16:11.740
and Special Summon it with its Attack Power lowered by 1000!

00:16:12.450 --> 00:16:16.580
Plus, during the turn it was Summoned,
 that Monster cannot be destroyed by battle.

00:16:17.330 --> 00:16:20.410
So I received 2000 damage.

00:16:22.000 --> 00:16:24.120
I end my turn with this.

00:16:24.580 --> 00:16:27.420
Tachyon Dragon's Attack Power returns to normal.

00:16:27.920 --> 00:16:30.760
Here I go! My turn! Draw!

00:16:31.380 --> 00:16:34.640
I activate the Magic Card, Resurrection of the Dead!

00:16:35.260 --> 00:16:37.720
I Special Summon Photon Slasher from the Graveyard!

00:16:39.680 --> 00:16:42.730
Then I Summon Photon Circler from my hand!

00:16:50.360 --> 00:16:54.320
Then, from my hand, I activate the Magic Card, Shift-Up!

00:16:55.570 --> 00:17:00.240
This card can raise the levels of all Monsters I control 
to the highest one on my field!

00:17:00.830 --> 00:17:03.410
There are three Level Eight Monsters...

00:17:04.040 --> 00:17:05.000
Is it coming?

00:17:09.340 --> 00:17:14.470
I Overlay the Level Eight Galaxy-Eyes, Photon Slasher, and Photon Circler!

00:17:15.010 --> 00:17:18.550
I use these three Monsters to build the Overlay Network!

00:17:18.720 --> 00:17:20.310
Xyz Summon!

00:17:21.140 --> 00:17:22.810
The reversed Galaxy,

00:17:22.980 --> 00:17:27.520
become a surging wave of light and show yourself!

00:17:31.360 --> 00:17:34.070
Descend, my very Soul!

00:17:34.240 --> 00:17:37.610
Neo Galaxy-Eyes Photon Dragon!

00:17:46.750 --> 00:17:48.880
Oh...! This is...

00:17:48.960 --> 00:17:52.630
When Neo Galaxy-Eyes Photon Dragon was Xyz Summoned,

00:17:52.840 --> 00:17:56.510
all Monster Effects except this one's are negated!

00:17:56.590 --> 00:17:58.300
Photon Howling!!

00:18:02.930 --> 00:18:05.270
Since its Monster Effects were negated,

00:18:05.560 --> 00:18:09.440
the characteristic of 'only Numbers can destroy Numbers' is also taken away!

00:18:10.230 --> 00:18:14.900
So is this why Neo Galaxy-Eyes is regarded as a fearsome Numbers Killer?

00:18:15.110 --> 00:18:17.990
I detach one Overlay Unit,

00:18:18.450 --> 00:18:22.990
and send all Overlay Units on the field
 to the Graveyard except for this Monster!

00:18:25.870 --> 00:18:29.330
Then, for every Overlay Unit sent to the Graveyard,

00:18:29.710 --> 00:18:31.880
it gains 500 Attack Points!

00:18:35.460 --> 00:18:38.380
Go, Neo Galaxy-Eyes Photon Dragon!

00:18:38.590 --> 00:18:41.350
Ultimate Photon Stream!!

00:18:54.900 --> 00:18:57.190
With this, I end my turn.

00:19:00.530 --> 00:19:02.240
Good, very good!

00:19:02.490 --> 00:19:06.120
That's what a Galaxy-Eyes user should be!

00:19:06.540 --> 00:19:07.750
Big talk for a loser!

00:19:08.290 --> 00:19:10.750
My turn! Draw!

00:19:11.540 --> 00:19:14.040
Then let me use this as well!

00:19:14.590 --> 00:19:17.670
I activate the Magic Card, Resurrection of the Dead!

00:19:17.920 --> 00:19:21.720
I Special Summon Galaxy-Eyes Tachyon Dragon from the Graveyard.

00:19:30.940 --> 00:19:34.310
If it's come to this,
it is only fitting that I fight for real.

00:19:35.650 --> 00:19:38.900
Barial Force!!

00:19:56.920 --> 00:20:00.380
Barian... So you finally show your true form.

00:20:00.760 --> 00:20:04.180
I see. So this is your true form.

00:20:04.550 --> 00:20:08.720
From now on, I'll show you the true power of Barian!

00:20:09.100 --> 00:20:12.480
Rank-Up Magic, Barian's Force, activate!

00:20:13.190 --> 00:20:17.360
This card can Rank-Up my Xyz Monster's Rank,

00:20:17.730 --> 00:20:20.400
and Special Summon one Chaos Xyz!

00:20:20.740 --> 00:20:25.450
I Overlay the Level Eight Galaxy-Eyes Tachyon Dragon!

00:20:26.160 --> 00:20:30.370
With this one Monster, I rebuild the Overlay Network!

00:20:31.330 --> 00:20:34.290
The Power of Barian born from Chaos...

00:20:34.620 --> 00:20:38.040
Dwell in the Numbers to create a new Chaos!

00:20:40.010 --> 00:20:42.340
Chaos Xyz Change!

00:20:44.380 --> 00:20:49.850
Pierce through the Galaxy and revive from before the creation of time!

00:20:51.220 --> 00:20:54.140
Surpass the eternal Dragon's Star!

00:20:54.350 --> 00:20:56.940
Chaos Number 107!

00:20:57.730 --> 00:21:01.070
Neo Galaxy-Eyes Tachyon Dragon!

00:21:03.530 --> 00:21:06.910
Neo Galaxy-Eyes Tachyon Dragon, you say?

00:21:10.330 --> 00:21:12.620
It's not working! It's got too much energy!

00:21:13.830 --> 00:21:15.960
At this rate, the Sphere Field will...!

00:21:25.130 --> 00:21:27.840
I'll save this Duel with you for later!

00:21:28.180 --> 00:21:29.550
My name is Misael!

00:21:30.640 --> 00:21:33.930
I am the one who will control both Galaxy-Eyes one day!

00:21:38.400 --> 00:21:39.520
Yuma!

00:21:49.450 --> 00:21:50.700
Kaito-<i>sama</i>!

00:22:17.690 --> 00:22:24.570
<i>Does the thought "In any case..." following</i>

00:22:24.990 --> 00:22:32.240
<i>the foreboding premonition tell you to give up?</i>

00:22:32.240 --> 00:22:39.830
<i>Do you laugh at your dreams, saying "impossible"?</i>

00:22:39.830 --> 00:22:47.170
<i>You must find it funny that I'm not able to laugh at it, right?</i>

00:22:47.720 --> 00:23:04.110
<i>This song supports me, so I'll do my best for you this time.
 It's my turn to sing now.</i>

00:23:04.110 --> 00:23:08.900
<i>I will vow to you here</i>

00:23:08.900 --> 00:23:19.250
<i>As long as I live, you'll always be my tiny, little friend</i>

00:23:19.250 --> 00:23:27.800
<i>I'll erase all those little mistakes of yours</i>

00:23:27.800 --> 00:23:32.590
<i>Because I want to become an artist</i>

00:23:34.390 --> 00:23:38.890
<i>Look, I like doing it 'cuz it's fun.</i>

00:23:41.350 --> 00:23:44.650
After the conflict with Misael, Yuma was heavily injured,

00:23:44.650 --> 00:23:48.070
with his heart trapped by his feeling of powerlessness.

00:23:48.990 --> 00:23:51.740
Having to look at Yuma in this state,
Shark decides to fight Yuma.

00:23:52.240 --> 00:23:54.160
Why should I Duel you?

00:23:54.320 --> 00:23:56.410
What is he trying to say?

00:23:56.790 --> 00:23:59.330
Damn! This guy really is strong!

00:24:00.330 --> 00:24:02.330
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh! ZeXal II!

00:24:02.460 --> 00:24:06.210
"Awaken!! Yuma vs Shark: The Duel of Revival"

00:24:06.800 --> 00:24:08.840
I will move forward with Astral!
